# Which commit of the shared test-input repository this branch of BloomDesktop tests against.
#
# The test-input collections (books, reference screenshots) used by
# src/BloomVisualRegressionTests live in their own public repository rather than in this one, so
# that other projects can use them and so that changing a test book does not churn this repository.
#
# `node build/get-testing-inputs.mjs` reads this file and materializes exactly this commit into
# output/testing-inputs/ (which is gitignored). Pinning a commit is what makes a test run
# reproducible: the same BloomDesktop commit always renders the same books against the same
# reference images.
#
# To advance the pin:
#   1. Make the change in a clone of the repository below and merge it there.
#   2. Put the new commit SHA in `commit` here, in the same branch/pull request as whatever
#      BloomDesktop change needs it.
#   3. Run `node build/get-testing-inputs.mjs` to update your own output/testing-inputs/.
#
# Format: one `key=value` per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.

repo=https://github.com/BloomBooks/bloom-testing-inputs.git
commit=3b69cfb30892202c9564f58290fa05a00f80f2ee
